[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440082426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98581#issuecomment-2440082426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98581","id":2440082426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RcLP6","user":{"login":"bikemurt","id":23486102,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDg2MTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23486102?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt","html_url":"https://github.com/bikemurt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikemurt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T16:11:41Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T16:11:41Z","body":"I don't think this is an engine bug. I stripped out the `wait` calls, and all the hitbox logic (they were throwing errors), and the animation tree moves to the \"attacking_machine\" with no problem via code. The \"Baked_Player_Blunt_Wep_Small_Attack_1_Return\" does not play because you transition away from \"return_node\" to \"End\" immediately inside that state machine - in other words, I don't think your conditions are set up properly.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e14fcbc2-a60f-478a-aa42-c5566bbe1bc4\r\n\r\nI've uploaded another MRP with those things stripped out that you can try out.\r\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17534588/MRP.zip)\r\n\r\nIf you really want to wait 3 seconds prior to switching to the attack animation, add this to the top of player.gd inside `_ready()`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nawait get_tree().create_timer(3.0).timeout\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440082426/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440118123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98581#issuecomment-2440118123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98581","id":2440118123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RcT9r","user":{"login":"hipturre","id":184962958,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwZPjg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184962958?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre","html_url":"https://github.com/hipturre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hipturre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T17:58:07Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T17:58:07Z","body":"Those transitions to end were just leftovers from when I first tried to fix the problem. I removed them and nothing changed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https